   "text": "The semi-random portion of the Deck Builder's Toolkit consists of 4 groups, out of 7 possible groups, each of 10 cards (5 Commons and 5 Uncommons) and representing one of the 7 possible deck strategies (1x Vampires, 1x Merfolk, 2x Dinosaurs, 2x Pirates and 1 x Ramp). The groups are separated by one of the four above mentioned Evolving Wilds:",
